<div style="text-align: left;">
  <span class="badge badge-success">SMTP Diagnostic Test</span>
  <h2 style="color: #0f172a; margin: 14px 0 8px 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800;">🩺 SMTP Test Passed!</h2>
  <p style="color: #475569; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
    Your <strong>{{appName}}</strong> SMTP backend is configured correctly and capable of delivering dynamic, HTML-formatted emails via Handlebars templates.
  </p>

  <!-- System health checklist -->
  <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 14px;">System Health Checklist:</p>
    <div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">✓</span> SMTP Transporter Connected</div>
    <div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Handlebars Template Engine Active</div>
    <div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Email Delivery Successful</div>
    <div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Database Connection Verified</div>
    <div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Layout Rendering Working</div>
  </div>

  <table class="meta-table" role="presentation">
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">📡 SMTP Host:</td>
      <td class="meta-val"><code style="background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b;">{{smtpHost}}:{{smtpPort}}</code></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">📤 Sender:</td>
      <td class="meta-val">{{senderEmail}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">📥 Delivered To:</td>
      <td class="meta-val" style="color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700;">{{recipientEmail}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">🗄️ Database:</td>
      <td class="meta-val"><span class="badge badge-info">{{databaseDialect}}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">🕐 Dispatched At:</td>
      <td class="meta-val">{{formattedDate}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="security-notice" style="border-left-color: #2563eb; background-color: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af;">
    <strong>ℹ️ System Note:</strong> Dynamic templating is powered by Handlebars with the <code style="background: rgba(37,99,235,0.1); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px;">main.handlebars</code> master layout. Templates include inline CSS optimized for cross-client compatibility, responsive design, and dark mode support.
  </div>
</div>
